#: includes/functions.php
msgid "The Syslog tables are not partitioned.  Traditional (non-partitioned) tables are deprecated, and partitioned tables are required for new installs.  Your data will continue to be collected, but you should migrate the syslog table to a partitioned architecture."
msgstr "Imbonerahamwe za Syslog ntizigabanyijemo ibice. Imbonerahamwe za kera (zitagabanyijemo ibice) zashaje, kandi imbonerahamwe zigabanyijemo ibice zirasabwa ku ishyirwaho rishya. Amakuru yawe azakomeza gukusanywa, ariko ugomba kwimura imbonerahamwe ya syslog ikajya mu buryo bugabanyijemo ibice."

#: includes/functions.php
