#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Syslog Upgrade Advisor"
msgstr "Umujyanama wo kuvugurura Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Upgrade Syslog from %s to %s? Existing messages and rules will be preserved. Schema changes may take time."
msgstr "Kuvugurura Syslog kuva kuri %s ujya kuri %s? Ubutumwa n'amategeko bihari bizagumaho. Impinduka mu miterere y'ububiko bishobora gufata umwanya."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "What upgrade/install type do you wish to use"
msgstr "Ni ubuhe bwoko bwo kuzamura/gushyiraho wifuza gukoresha"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "When you have very large tables, performing a Truncate will be much quicker.  If you are concerned about archive data, you can choose either Inline, which will freeze your browser for the period of this upgrade, or background, which will create a background process to bring your old syslog data from a backup table to the new syslog format.  Again this process can take several hours.  A Truncate discards the stored syslog and removed messages only; alert, removal and report rules are always kept."
msgstr "Iyo ufite imbonerahamwe nini cyane, gukora Truncate byihuta cyane. Niba uhangayikishijwe n'amakuru yabitswe, ushobora guhitamo Inline, bizahagarika mucukumbuzi yawe mu gihe cy'iri vugurura, cyangwa background, bizakora igikorwa cyo mu nyuma kizana amakuru yawe ashaje ya syslog kuva mu mbonerahamwe y'ububiko kikayashyira mu buryo bushya bwa syslog. Nanone iki gikorwa gishobora kumara amasaha menshi. Truncate ijugunya gusa ubutumwa bwa syslog bubitswe n'ubwakuwemo; amategeko y'impuruza, ayo gukuraho n'aya raporo agumaho buri gihe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Truncate Syslog Table"
msgstr "Gusiba ibiri mu Mbonerahamwe ya Syslog"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Inline Upgrade"
msgstr "Ivugurura ryo mu murongo"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Background Upgrade"
msgstr "Ivugurura rikorwa mu nyuma"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Database Storage Engine"
msgstr "Moteri y'ububiko bw'amakuru"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The storage engine for the analytical tables.  Only InnoDB and, on MariaDB, Aria storage engines are supported.  Any Remote Data Collector option requires InnoDB; incompatible combinations cannot be submitted."
msgstr "Moteri y'ububiko y'imbonerahamwe z'isesengura.  Gusa InnoDB na, kuri MariaDB, moteri z'ububiko za Aria ni zo zemewe.  Uburyo bwose bw'Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure busaba InnoDB; ibihujwe bitajyanye ntibishobora koherezwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "InnoDB Storage"
msgstr "Ububiko bwa InnoDB"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria Storage"
msgstr "Ububiko bwa Aria"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Timestamp Precision"
msgstr "Ubuziranenge bw'Igihe Cyanditswe"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond precision stores sub-second syslog timestamps in a TIMESTAMP(3) column and is only available on MariaDB.  Second precision uses a standard TIMESTAMP column.  On a production system, use cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms during a maintenance window to convert existing messages without discarding them."
msgstr "Ubushishozi bwa milisegonda bubika ibihe bya syslog biri munsi y'isogonda mu nkingi ya TIMESTAMP(3) kandi buboneka kuri MariaDB gusa.  Ubushishozi bw'isogonda bukoresha inkingi isanzwe ya TIMESTAMP.  Kuri sisitemu ikora mu kazi, koresha cli/upgrade_partitioning.php --convert-ms mu gihe cyo gusana kugira ngo uhindure ubutumwa buhari utabujugunye."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Millisecond - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB only)"
msgstr "Milisegonda - TIMESTAMP(3) (MariaDB gusa)"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Second - TIMESTAMP"
msgstr "Isegonda - TIMESTAMP"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Message Processing"
msgstr "Itunganywa ry'Ubutumwa bwo Kure"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Remote Data Collector Message Processing"
msgstr "Fungura Itunganywa ry'Ubutumwa bw'Ikusanyamakuru rya Kure"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process their messages independently, check this checkbox.  By checking this Checkbox, your Remote Data Collectors will need to maintain their own 'config_local.php' file in order to inform Syslog to use an independent database for message display and processing.  Please use the template file 'config_local.php.dist' for this purpose.  WARNING: Syslog tables will be automatically created as soon as this option is enabled."
msgstr "Niba Abakusanya Amakuru ba Kure bawe bafite ububiko bwabo bw'amakuru bwa Syslog kandi bakatunganya ubutumwa bwabo mu buryo bwigenga, shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku. Mu gushyira akamenyetso muri aka Gasanduku, Abakusanya Amakuru ba Kure bawe bazakenera kugira dosiye yabo bwite ya 'config_local.php' kugira ngo bamenyeshe Syslog gukoresha ububiko bw'amakuru bwigenga mu kwerekana no gutunganya ubutumwa. Nyamuneka koresha dosiye y'inyandikorugero 'config_local.php.dist' kuri iki gikorwa. IBURIRA: Imbonerahamwe za Syslog zizahangwa mu buryo bwikora ako kanya ubu buryo bufunguwe."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Data Collector Rules Sync"
msgstr "Guhuza Amategeko y'Ikusanyamakuru ryo Kure"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "If your Remote Data Collectors have their own Syslog databases and process thrie messages independently, check this checkbox if you wish the Main Cacti databases Alerts, Removal and Report rules to be sent to the Remote Cacti System."
msgstr "Niba Abakusanya Amakuru ba Kure bawe bafite ububiko bwabo bw'amakuru bwa Syslog kandi bakatunganya ubutumwa bwabo mu buryo bwigenga, shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku niba wifuza ko amategeko y'Impuruza, ayo Gukuraho n'aya Raporo by'ububiko bw'amakuru bukuru bwa Cacti byoherezwa kuri Sisitemu ya Cacti ya Kure."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Store Records on Remote Collector"
msgstr "Bika ibyabitswe ku ikusanyamakuru rya kure"

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Keep processed messages in the remote collector syslog table after they have been delivered to the Main Collector. When disabled, records are retained locally only while the Main Collector is unavailable and are removed after confirmed recovery delivery."
msgstr "Bika ubutumwa bwatunganyijwe mu mbonerahamwe ya syslog y'ikusanyamakuru rya kure nyuma y'uko bugejejwe ku Ikusanyamakuru Rikuru. Iyo byahagaritswe, inyandiko zibikwa imbere gusa mu gihe Ikusanyamakuru Rikuru ritaboneka kandi zisibwa nyuma y'uko iyoherezwa ryemejwe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Retention Policy"
msgstr "Politiki yo kubika"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Choose how many days of Syslog values you wish to maintain in the database."
msgstr "Hitamo umubare w'iminsi y'amakuru ya Syslog wifuza kubika mu bubiko bw'amakuru."

#: includes/installer.php includes/settings.php
msgid "Partitioning Level"
msgstr "Urwego rwo kugabanya mu bice"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables.  Daily is recommended.  Hourly requires a finite retention, and the retention and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit.  To change the level later, change it in Settings and run cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."
msgstr "Ingano ya buri gice cy'imbonerahamwe za syslog na syslog_removed.  Buri munsi ni byo byifuzwa.  Buri saha bisaba igihe ntarengwa cyo kubika, kandi igihe cyo kubika n'urwego rw'igabanyabice hamwe bigomba kujyana n'umubare ntarengwa w'ibice wa seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru.  Kugira ngo uhindure urwego nyuma, ruhindure mu Magenamiterere maze ukoreshe cli/upgrade_partitioning.php."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Upgrade"
msgstr "Zamura verisiyo"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Install"
msgstr "Injiza"

#: includes/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "Syslog %s Advisor"
msgstr "Umujyanama wa Syslog %s"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "WARNING: Syslog Upgrade is Time Consuming!!!"
msgstr "IBURIRA: Kuvugurura Syslog bitwara igihe kirekire!!!"

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "The upgrade of the 'main' syslog table can be a very time consuming process.  As such, it is recommended that you either reduce the size of your syslog table prior to upgrading, or choose the background option."
msgstr "Kuvugurura imbonerahamwe ya syslog ya 'main' bishobora gutwara igihe kirekire cyane. Ku bw'ibyo, birasabwa ko wagabanya ingano y'imbonerahamwe yawe ya syslog mbere yo kuvugurura, cyangwa ugahitamo uburyo bwo kubikorera mu nyuma."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "If you choose the background option, your legacy syslog table will be renamed, and a new syslog table will be created.  Then, an upgrade process will be launched in the background.  Again, this background process can take quite a bit of time to complete.  However, your data will be preserved."
msgstr "Niba uhisemo uburyo bwo gukorera inyuma, imbonerahamwe yawe ya kera ya syslog izahindurirwa izina, kandi hazahangwa imbonerahamwe nshya ya syslog. Hanyuma, igikorwa cyo kuvugurura kizatangizwa gikorera inyuma. Nanone, iki gikorwa gikorera inyuma gishobora gutwara igihe kirekire kugira ngo kirangire. Icyakora, amakuru yawe azabungabungwa."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Regardless of your choice, all existing removal and alert rules will be maintained during the upgrade process."
msgstr "Uko waba wahisemo kose, amategeko yose asanzwe yo gukuraho n'ay'impuguro azagumaho mu gihe cyo kuvugurura."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Press <b>'Upgrade'</b> to proceed with the upgrade, or <b>'Cancel'</b> to return to the Plugins menu."
msgstr "Kanda <b>'Kuzamura'</b> kugira ngo ukomeze kuzamura verisiyo, cyangwa <b>'Hagarika'</b> kugira ngo usubire ku rutonde rw'Imigereka."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also set the database storage engine for the analytical tables syslog and syslog_remove.  Only the InnoDB storage engine and, on MariaDB, the Aria storage engine are supported.  If using MariaDB, we recommend the Aria Storage Engine when no Remote Data Collector options are enabled; collector options require InnoDB."
msgstr "Ushobora kandi gushyiraho moteri y'ububiko bw'amakuru ku mbonerahamwe z'isesengura syslog na syslog_remove. Moteri y'ububiko ya InnoDB gusa, na moteri y'ububiko ya Aria kuri MariaDB, ni zo zishyigikiwe. Niba ukoresha MariaDB, tugira inama yo gukoresha Moteri y'Ububiko ya Aria igihe nta mahitamo ya Remote Data Collector afunguwe; amahitamo y'ikusanyamakuru asaba InnoDB."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You have several options to choose from when installing Syslog.  The first is the Database Architecture.  Partitioned tables are the only supported architecture as they prevent the size of the tables from becoming excessive thus slowing queries.  Traditional non-partitioned tables are deprecated and are no longer offered for new installs."
msgstr "Ufite amahitamo menshi ushobora gutoranyamo igihe ushyiramo Syslog.  Irya mbere ni Imiterere y'Ububikoshingiro.  Imbonerahamwe zigabanyijemo ibice ni yo miterere yonyine ishyigikiwe kuko irinda ko ubunini bw'imbonerahamwe buba bunini cyane bukadindiza ishakisha.  Imbonerahamwe zisanzwe zitagabanyijemo ibice zarashaje kandi ntizigitangwa ku ishyirwamo rishya."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also choose the timestamp precision.  Millisecond precision (TIMESTAMP(3)) preserves sub-second ordering of incoming messages and is only available on MariaDB; MySQL installs use second precision.  This cannot be changed in place later without destroying the stored messages."
msgstr "Ushobora kandi guhitamo ubuziranenge bw'igihe. Ubuziranenge bw'igice cy'isegonda (TIMESTAMP(3)) bubika urutonde rwo munsi y'isegonda rw'ubutumwa bwinjira kandi buboneka gusa kuri MariaDB; iyinjizwa rya MySQL rikoresha ubuziranenge bw'isegonda. Ibi ntibishobora guhindurwa nyuma aho biri hadasenywe ubutumwa bubitswe."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "Aria storage is unavailable while any Remote Data Collector option is enabled. InnoDB has been selected."
msgstr "Ububiko bwa Aria ntibuboneka igihe hari ihitamo iryo ari ryo ryose ry'Ikusanyamakuru rya kure ryafunguwe. InnoDB yahiswemo."

#: includes/installer.php
msgid "You can also select the retention duration.  Please keep in mind that if you have several hosts logging to syslog, this table can become quite large."
msgstr "Ushobora kandi guhitamo igihe cyo kubika. Nyamuneka wibuke ko niba ufite Abakirizi benshi bandika muri syslog, iyi mbonerahamwe ishobora kuba nini cyane."

