#: includes/settings.php
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rusange"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Enabled"
msgstr "Syslog yafunguwe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, records will be transferred from the Syslog Incoming table to the main syslog table and Alerts and Reports will be enabled.  Please keep in mind that if the system is disabled log entries will still accumulate into the Syslog Incoming table as this is defined by the rsyslog or syslog-ng process."
msgstr "Niba aka gasanduku kashyizweho akamenyetso, inyandiko zizimurwa zivuye mu mbonerahamwe ya Syslog Incoming zijya mu mbonerahamwe nyamukuru ya syslog kandi Impuruza na Raporo bizafungurwa. Nyamuneka uzirikane ko niba sisitemu yahagaritswe, ibyanditswe mu nyandiko z'ibikorwa bizakomeza kwiyongera mu mbonerahamwe ya Syslog Incoming kuko ibi bigenwa na porogaramu ya rsyslog cyangwa syslog-ng."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Forward alarms to Alarm Manager"
msgstr "Ohereza impuruza ku Mugenzuzi w'Impuruza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Allow rules set to Alarm Manager to forward alarms. Syslog email remains the fallback; command actions run only for Syslog Alarming rules."
msgstr "Emera amategeko yashyizwe kuri Alarm Manager yohereze imiburo imbere. Imeyili ya Syslog ikomeza kuba uburyo bw'ubutabazi; ibikorwa by'amabwiriza bikora gusa ku mategeko ya Syslog Alarming."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Strip Domains"
msgstr "Kuraho amadomene"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "A comma delimited list of domains that you wish to remove from the syslog hostname, Examples would be 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"
msgstr "Urutonde rutandukanyijwe n'akitso rw'indangarubuga wifuza gukura ku izina rya mwakirizi ya syslog, Ingero zaba 'mydomain.com, otherdomain.com'"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Refresh Interval"
msgstr "Intera yo kuvugurura"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the time in seconds before the page refreshes."
msgstr "Iki ni igihe mu masegonda mbere y'uko urupapuro ruvugururwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip Total Row Count"
msgstr "Simbuka ibarura rusange ry'imirongo"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs do not count every matching record, which can be very expensive on large installations. The page shows Previous and Next links instead of a total and page list, and Next is offered while more records remain."
msgstr "Niba aka gasanduku kashyizweho akamenyetso, ududirishya twa System Logs na Alert Logs ntitubara buri nyandiko ihura, ibi bishobora gutwara ubushobozi bwinshi ku mashyirwamo manini. Urupapuro rwerekana amahuza ya Ibanza n'Ikurikira aho kwerekana igiteranyo n'urutonde rw'amapaji, kandi Ikurikira ritangwa mu gihe hari izindi nyandiko zisigaye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Max Report Records"
msgstr "Inyandiko za raporo ntarengwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "For Threshold based Alerts, what is the maximum number that you wish to show in the report.  This is used to limit the size of the html log and Email."
msgstr "Ku mpuruza zishingiye ku Rwego ntarengwa, ni uwuhe mubare ntarengwa wifuza kwerekana muri raporo. Ibi bikoreshwa mu kugabanya ubunini bw'inyandiko ya html na Imeyili."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Records"
msgstr "Ibyanditswe %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Syslog Processing Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa ntarengwa bitunganya Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When set above 1, incoming message processing is spread across parallel worker processes.  Each worker handles a disjoint range of incoming messages, speeding up hostname resolution and message transfer under heavy loads.  A setting of 1 processes all messages in a single process.  Worker processes are not supported on Windows or when the PHP pcntl and POSIX extensions are unavailable, in which case processing falls back to a single process."
msgstr "Iyo bishyizwe hejuru ya 1, itunganywa ry'ubutumwa bwinjira rigabanywa mu bikorwa by'abakozi bikora icyarimwe. Buri mukozi yita ku gice cyihariye cy'ubutumwa bwinjira, bigatuma gushaka amazina y'abakirizi no kwimura ubutumwa byihuta mu gihe hari umutwaro mwinshi. Igenamiterere rya 1 ritunganya ubutumwa bwose mu gikorwa kimwe. Ibikorwa by'abakozi ntibishoboka kuri Windows cyangwa iyo imigereka ya PHP pcntl na POSIX itaboneka, icyo gihe itunganywa risubira ku gikorwa kimwe."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Process"
msgstr "Igikorwa gitunganya %d"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Worker Processes"
msgstr "Ibikorwa bitunganya %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Command for Opening Tickets"
msgstr "Itegeko ryo gufungura amatike"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This command will be executed for opening Help Desk Tickets.  The command will be required to parse multiple input parameters as follows: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>.  The hostlist will be a comma delimited list of hosts impacted by the alert."
msgstr "Iri tegeko rizashyirwa mu bikorwa mu gufungura amatike ya Help Desk. Iri tegeko rizasabwa gusesengura ibipimo byinshi byinjizwa nk'uku: <b>--alert-name</b>, <b>--severity</b>, <b>--hostlist</b>, <b>--message</b>. Urutonde rwa hostlist ruzaba ari urutonde rw'abakirizi bagezweho n'intabaza rutandukanyijwe n'akitso."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Host Discovery Options"
msgstr "Amahitamo yo gushakisha Mwakirizi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable Hostname Resolution"
msgstr "Fungura Gusesengura Izina rya Mwakirizi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all hostnames are resolved via DNS lookup first (If enabled), using A and AAAA records. IPv4 and IPv6 addresses need no lookup, and IPv6 addresses are stored in compressed lower case form. If the DNS lookup fails, the system will attempt to resolve the hostname against the Cacti host table and replace it with the Cacti host description. If both DNS and Cacti lookups fail, records are assigned a prefix 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."
msgstr "Niba aka gasanduku kashyizweho akamenyetso, amazina ya Mwakirizi yose abanza gushakirwa binyuze muri DNS (Niba byafunguwe), hakoreshejwe inyandiko za A na AAAA. Aderesi za IPv4 na IPv6 ntizikenera gushakirwa, kandi aderesi za IPv6 zibikwa mu buryo buhinnye bw'inyuguti ntoya. Niba ishakisha rya DNS ritsinzwe, sisitemu izagerageza gushakira izina rya Mwakirizi mu mbonerahamwe ya Mwakirizi ya Cacti maze irisimbuze ibisobanuro bya Mwakirizi bya Cacti. Niba ishakisha rya DNS n'irya Cacti byombi bitsinzwe, inyandiko zihabwa intangiriro 'unresolved-Original_hostname'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Skip DNS Resolution for incoming hosts"
msgstr "Simbuka isesengura rya DNS ku bakirizi binjira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, the system will not attempt to resolve hosts via DNS lookups.  This is useful for environments where DNS resolution is not possible or not desired."
msgstr "Niba aka gasanduku kashyizweho akamenyetso, sisitemu ntizagerageza gushakira Ba Mwakirizi binyuze mu ishakisha rya DNS. Ibi ni ingenzi mu mikorere aho gushakira kuri DNS bidashoboka cyangwa bidakenewe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "HTML Notification Settings"
msgstr "Amagenamiterere y'imenyesha rya HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Enable HTML Based Email"
msgstr "Fungura Imeyili Ishingiye kuri HTML"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If this checkbox is set, all Emails will be sent in HTML format.  Otherwise, Emails will be sent in plain text."
msgstr "Niba aka gasanduku kashyizweho akamenyetso, Imeyili zose zizoherezwa mu buryo bwa HTML. Bitabaye ibyo, Imeyili zizoherezwa mu nyandiko isanzwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Format File to Use"
msgstr "Idosiye y'imiterere yo gukoresha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Choose the custom html wrapper and CSS file to use.  This file contains both html and CSS to wrap around your report.  If it contains more than simply CSS, you need to place a special <REPORT> tag inside of the file.  This format tag will be replaced by the report content.  These files are located in the 'formats' directory."
msgstr "Hitamo idosiye yihariye ya html n'iya CSS yo gukoresha.  Iyi dosiye irimo byombi, html na CSS, byo gukikiza raporo yawe.  Niba irimo ibirenze CSS gusa, ugomba gushyira akamenyetso kihariye <REPORT> imbere muri iyo dosiye.  Aka kamenyetso k'imiterere kazasimburwa n'ibikubiye muri raporo.  Izi dosiye ziherereye mu bubiko bwa 'formats'."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Data Retention and Partitioning"
msgstr "Kubika amakuru no kugabanya ibice"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Retention"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kubika Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep events."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare w'iminsi yo kubika ibyabaye."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The size of each partition of the syslog and syslog_removed tables. A change is saved here but takes effect only when cli/upgrade_partitioning.php rebuilds both tables; until then, partition maintenance keeps the existing size. Hourly partitioning requires a finite retention. The retention, pre-create window and partitioning level together must fit the database server's partition limit, or the settings are not saved."
msgstr "Ingano ya buri gice cy'imbonerahamwe za syslog na syslog_removed. Impinduka ibikwa hano ariko itangira gukora gusa igihe cli/upgrade_partitioning.php yongeye kubaka imbonerahamwe zombi; kugeza icyo gihe, ubusigasire bw'ibice bukomeza gukoresha ingano isanzwe. Igabanyabice rya buri saha risaba igihe ntarengwa cyo kubika. Igihe cyo kubika, igihe cyo kurema mbere n'urwego rw'igabanyabice hamwe bigomba kujyana n'umubare ntarengwa w'ibice wa seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru, bitabaye ibyo amagenamiterere ntabikwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Pre-create Window"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kurema ibice mbere y'igihe"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days of future partitions to maintain for partitioned Syslog tables, so that new partitions are always split from an empty dMaxValue partition.  Hourly partitioning always keeps at least 2 days."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare w'iminsi y'ibice by'igihe kizaza bigomba kubungabungwa ku mbonerahamwe za Syslog zigabanyijwemo ibice, kugira ngo ibice bishya bihoraho bitandukanywa n'igice cya dMaxValue kirimo ubusa.  Igabanya rya buri saha rihora ribika nibura iminsi 2."

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Day"
msgstr "Umunsi %d"

#: includes/settings.php syslog_alerts.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Days"
msgstr "Iminsi %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Partition Recovery Limit"
msgstr "Urwego ntarengwa rwo kugarura ibice"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When partitions are missing (for example after maintenance downtime), at most this many missing partitions per table are created on each poller run.  The remaining gap heals over subsequent runs; retention pruning stays deferred until the future partition horizon is fully restored.  Applies to partitioned Syslog tables only."
msgstr "Iyo ibice by'imbonerahamwe (partitions) bibura (urugero nyuma y'ihagarara ry'imirimo yo gusana), umubare ntarengwa w'ibice bibura ku mbonerahamwe bikorwa muri buri nshuro y'Ikusanyamakuru ungana gutya. Icyuho gisigaye gikemuka mu nshuro zikurikiraho; gusiba ibibitswe bikomeza gutegereza kugeza igihe ibice bizaza bisubijweho mu buryo bwuzuye. Bireba imbonerahamwe za Syslog zigabanyijwemo ibice gusa."

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partition per run"
msgstr "Igice %d kuri buri gikorwa"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Partitions per run"
msgstr "Ibice %d kuri buri gikorwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Collector Staleness Threshold"
msgstr "Urwego ntarengwa rw'ubusaze bw'ikusanya"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline health alerts warn when unprocessed messages, processing completion, or queued synchronization exceed this delay. The effective delay is at least three poller intervals and 300 seconds. Set to 0 to use 300 seconds."
msgstr "Integuza z'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro w'amakuru zitanga iburira igihe ubutumwa butarakorwa, irangira ry'itunganya, cyangwa ihuza ritegereje birenze ubu bukererwe. Ubukererwe nyakuri ni byibura intera eshatu z'Ikusanyamakuru n'amasegonda 300. Shyira kuri 0 kugira ngo ukoreshe amasegonda 300."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (300 seconds)"
msgstr "Mburabuzi (amasegonda 300)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d seconds"
msgstr "amasegonda %d"

