#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Syslog Status page shows a warning when more than this many messages sit unprocessed in the Syslog Incoming table.  Set to 0 to use the default of 10000 messages."
msgstr "Paji y'Imiterere ya Syslog yerekana iburira igihe ubutumwa burenze uyu mubare bubitse butaratunganywa mu mbonerahamwe ya Syslog Incoming. Shiraho 0 kugira ngo ukoreshe igipimo gisanzwe cy'ubutumwa 10000."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default (10000 messages)"
msgstr "Mburabuzi (ubutumwa 10000)"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Messages"
msgstr "Ubutumwa %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Alerts"
msgstr "Integuza z'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro w'amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Notification List"
msgstr "Urutonde rw'imenyesha ry'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro w'amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Select an existing Thold notification list for pipeline health alerts. Enabled list recipients are combined with the email addresses below, preserving BCC recipients. Lists require the Thold notification-list table."
msgstr "Hitamo urutonde rw'imenyekanisha rwa Thold rusanzweho ku mpuruza z'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro. Abakira ku rutonde rwafunguwe bahuzwa na aderesi z'imeyili ziri hasi aha, hagumishwaho abakira ba BCC. Intonde zisaba imbonerahamwe y'urutonde rw'imenyekanisha rwa Thold."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Email Recipients"
msgstr "Abakira Imeyili z'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro w'amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Comma-separated email recipients for pipeline failures and recovery. Leave blank and select no notification list to disable email; health remains visible on the Status tab and state changes are logged. Checks require the Cacti poller to run."
msgstr "Abahabwa imeyili batandukanyijwe n'akitso igihe umuyoboro ugize ikibazo cyangwa ugarutse ku murongo. Reka hari ubusa kandi ntuhitemo urutonde rw'amamenyesha kugira ngo uhagarike imeyili; ubuzima bukomeza kugaragara ku gice cy'Imiterere kandi impinduka z'imiterere zirandikwa. Igenzura risaba ko ikusanyamakuru rya Cacti rikora."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pipeline Health Reminder Interval"
msgstr "Intera y'ibukiranya ry'ubuzima bw'umuyoboro w'amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Repeat notifications for ongoing pipeline problems after this interval. Failed email attempts are retried no more than once every five minutes."
msgstr "Subiramo amamenyesha ku bibazo bikomeje by'umuyoboro nyuma y'iki gihe. Ibigeragezo by'imeyili byananiranye byongerwa gusubirwamo bitarenze rimwe mu minota itanu."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Syslog Alert Retention"
msgstr "Igihe cyo kubika intabaza za Syslog"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "This is the number of days to keep alert logs."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare w'iminsi yo kubika inyandikamateka z'amamenyesha."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Alert Suppression and Maintenance"
msgstr "Guhagarika by'agateganyo Integuza no Kubungabunga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Days"
msgstr "Iminsi y'Igihe cyo Kubungabunga"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Days when all alert notifications are muted during the configured maintenance timeframe."
msgstr "Iminsi imenyesha ryose ry'impuruza riba ryahagaritswe mu gihe cyagenwe cy'imirimo yo kubungabunga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Starts"
msgstr "Igihe cyo Kubungabunga Gitangira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local start time for the global maintenance window."
msgstr "Igihe cyo gutangiriraho cy'aho uherereye ku gihe rusange cyo kubungabunga."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Window Ends"
msgstr "Igihe cyo Kubungabunga Kirangira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Local end time for the global maintenance window. An earlier end time continues into the next day."
msgstr "Igihe cyo kurangiriraho cy'aho uherereye ku gihe rusange cyo kubungabunga. Igihe cyo kurangiriraho kiri mbere gikomeza ku munsi ukurikiyeho."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Starts"
msgstr "Imirimo y'isana y'inshuro imwe iratangira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to start a one-time global maintenance window."
msgstr "Itariki n'isaha by'aho utuye bitari ngombwa byo gutangira igihe rusange cy'imirimo y'isana y'inshuro imwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "One-time Maintenance Ends"
msgstr "Imirimo y'isana y'inshuro imwe irarangira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Optional local date and time to end a one-time global maintenance window. Format: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."
msgstr "Itariki n'isaha by'aho utuye bitari ngombwa byo kurangiza igihe rusange cy'imirimo y'isana y'inshuro imwe. Imiterere: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Alert Cooldown"
msgstr "Igihe mburabuzi cyo gutegereza hagati y'impuruza"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress any repeat notification for the same rule and reporting scope for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Hagarika imenyesha iryo ari ryo ryose risubiramo ku itegeko rimwe n'aho raporo igera muri iyi minota. Agaciro ka buri tegeko gasimbura iri genamiterere. Shyiraho 0 kugira ngo bihagarikwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Default Duplicate Suppression"
msgstr "Gukumira mburabuzi ububiri bw'ubutumwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Suppress a notification with the same matched message set for this many minutes. Per-rule values override this setting. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr "Hagarika imenyesha rifite ubutumwa bumwe bwahuye muri iyi minota. Agaciro ka buri tegeko gasimbura iri genamiterere. Shyiraho 0 kugira ngo bihagarikwe."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Remote Syslog Recovery"
msgstr "Isubiramo rya Syslog yo Kure"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum Recovery Records Per Execution"
msgstr "Inyandiko zo kugarura amakuru ntarengwa kuri buri gikorwa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Maximum number of retained remote Syslog events sent to the Main Collector by one recovery worker execution. Each central database transaction remains capped at 100 records. Increase gradually while observing Main Collector load and lock waits."
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'ibikorwa bya Syslog ya kure byabitswe byoherezwa ku Gikusanyamakuru Gikuru n'igikorwa kimwe cyo kugarura amakuru. Buri gikorwa cyo mu bubiko bw'amakuru bukuru gikomeza kugira umupaka w'inyandiko 100. Ongera buhoro buhoro ureba umutwaro w'Igikusanyamakuru Gikuru n'igihe cyo gutegereza ifungwa."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Recovery Pause Between Batches"
msgstr "Akaruhuko ko kugarura hagati y'amatsinda"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Pause between each 100-record Main Collector delivery transaction. A longer pause lowers Main Collector pressure; a shorter pause speeds backlog convergence."
msgstr "Akaruhuko hagati ya buri gikorwa cyo kohereza amakuru 100 ku Ikusanyamakuru Rikuru. Akaruhuko karekare kagabanya umuvuduko kuri Ikusanyamakuru Rikuru; akaruhuko gato kihutisha kurangiza ibikirarane."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "No pause"
msgstr "Nta guhagarara"

