msgstr "Komande y'integuza"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "When an Alert is triggered, run the following command.  The following replacement variables are available <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>.  Please note that <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> is only available on individual thresholds.  These replacement values can appear on the command line, or be gathered from the environment of the script.  When used from the environment, those variables will be prefixed with 'ALERT_'."
msgstr "Iyo impuruza itanzwe, koresha iri tegeko rikurikira. Ibipimo byo gusimbura bikurikira biraboneka: <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;ALERTID&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;MESSAGE&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;FACILITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;PRIORITY&gt;'</b>, <b>'&lt;SEVERITY&gt;'</b>. Menya ko <b>'&lt;HOSTNAME&gt;'</b> iboneka gusa ku nzego ntarengwa ku giti cyazo. Ibi bipimo byo gusimbura bishobora gukoreshwa ku murongo w'amabwiriza cyangwa bigakurwa mu bidukikije bya porogaramu. Iyo bikoreshejwe bivuye mu bidukikije, ibyo bipimo bibanzirizwa na 'ALERT_'."

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Recovery command"
msgstr "Ibwiriza ryo kugarura"

#: syslog_alerts.php
msgid "Optional command to run when this threshold recovers after its quiet period. Uses the same replacement variables as Alert command. SYSLOG_EVENT is clear; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID matches the breach command. Failed commands are retried. Leave blank to disable."
msgstr "Itegeko ritari ngombwa ryo gukoresha iyo uru rwego ntarengwa rukize nyuma y'igihe cyarwo cyo gutuza. Rikoresha ibihinduka bisimbura bimwe n'iby'itegeko ry'Impuruza. SYSLOG_EVENT iba isobanutse; SYSLOG_BREACH_ID ihura n'itegeko ry'irenga ry'urwego. Amategeko yananiranye yongera kugeragezwa. Siga harimo ubusa kugira ngo bihagarikwe."

