msgstr "Inama"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The supplier of the device or software that logs this message, for example Cisco or Juniper."
msgstr "Uwatanze igikoresho cyangwa porogaramu yandika ubu butumwa, urugero nka Cisco cyangwa Juniper."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Vendor"
msgstr "Umucuruzi"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifier"
msgstr "Ikiranga"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The message code to look for, for example %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN or 4625. It must equal a whole word of the syslog message (letters, digits and _ . - /); a leading % is literal and must match as written. The match is not case sensitive. See How Recommendations Are Matched on the list page."
msgstr "Kode y'ubutumwa yo gushaka, urugero %LINK-3-UPDOWN, RPD_OSPF_NBRDOWN cyangwa 4625. Igomba guhura n'ijambo ryose ry'ubutumwa bwa syslog (inyuguti, imibare na _ . - /); % ibanza ni iy'ukuri kandi igomba guhura uko yanditswe. Guhuza ntibita ku nyuguti nkuru cyangwa nto. Reba Uko Ibyifuzo Bihuzwa ku rupapuro rw'urutonde."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Component"
msgstr "Igice"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The facility, module or subsystem that raises the message."
msgstr "Urwego rw'ubutumwa (facility), igice cyangwa igice cyungirije cya sisitemu gisohora ubutumwa."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The severity the vendor documents for this message."
msgstr "Uburemere uwatanze serivisi agaragaza kuri ubu butumwa."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
