msgstr "Amahuza agana ku nyandiko z'uwakoze igikoresho, rimwe kuri buri murongo."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [edit]"
msgstr "Inama [hindura]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Recommendation [new]"
msgstr "Inama [nshya]"

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A lightbulb before the message marks matching recommendations on the System Logs and Alert Logs tabs. Click the message to read them in the details flyout. Hovering never requests the server."
msgstr "Itara ribanza imbere y'ubutumwa rigaragaza inama zihura ku bice bya System Logs na Alert Logs. Kanda ku butumwa kugira ngo ubisome mu dirishya ry'ibisobanuro birambuye. Kuyoboraho imbeba ntibisaba seriveri."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Only the <b>Identifier</b> column is used for matching. The vendor, component, severity, message and explanation are shown in the details flyout but are never searched."
msgstr "Inkingi ya <b>Indangamwirondoro</b> gusa ni yo ikoreshwa mu guhuza. Utanga igikoresho, igice, ubukana, ubutumwa n'ibisobanuro bigaragara mu kadirishya k'ibisobanuro birambuye ariko ntibishakishwa na rimwe."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "The first 2,048 characters of the message are split into words. A word is a run of letters, digits and the characters _ . - / that may start with %. Every other character, such as a space, colon, comma or bracket, ends a word. In <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> the words are <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> and <code>down</code>."
msgstr "Inyuguti 2.048 za mbere z'ubutumwa zikatwamo amagambo. Ijambo ni urukurikirane rw'inyuguti, imibare n'ibimenyetso _ . - / rushobora gutangirwa na %. Ikindi kimenyetso icyo ari cyo cyose, nk'umwanya, utudomo tubiri, akitso cyangwa uruzitiro, kirangiza ijambo. Muri <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN: Interface Gi0/1, changed state to down</code> amagambo ni <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, <code>Interface</code>, <code>Gi0/1</code>, <code>changed</code>, <code>state</code>, <code>to</code> na <code>down</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "An identifier matches when it is <b>exactly equal to one whole word</b>, ignoring case. It is not a \"contains\", \"starts with\" or \"ends with\" search, and there are no wildcards: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> does not match the word <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, and <code>UPDOWN</code> does not match <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."
msgstr "Ikimenyetso kirahura iyo <b>kingana neza n'ijambo rimwe ryuzuye</b>, utitaye ku nyuguti nkuru cyangwa nto. Si ishakisha rya \"birimo\", \"bitangirira kuri\" cyangwa \"birangirira kuri\", kandi nta bimenyetso bisimbura bihari: <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> ntihura n'ijambo <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN-EXT</code>, na <code>UPDOWN</code> ntihura na <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "A leading <b>%</b> is literal, not a wildcard, and must match the message word as written. An identifier <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> matches the message word <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, not <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; an identifier without the prefix matches only the unprefixed word."
msgstr "<b>%</b> ibanza ni inyuguti nyayo, si ikimenyetso gisimbura byose, kandi igomba guhura n'ijambo ry'ubutumwa nk'uko ryanditse. Ikirango <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code> gihura n'ijambo ry'ubutumwa <code>%LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>, ntabwo ari <code>LINK-3-UPDOWN</code>; ikirango kidafite imbanziriza gihura gusa n'ijambo ridafite imbanziriza."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "When the syslog host is a Cacti device whose vendor is recognised from its SNMP system description or device template, and recommendations exist for that vendor, only that vendor's recommendations and those without a vendor are checked. Otherwise all vendors are checked, but an identifier made only of digits matches only recommendations without a vendor. When several recommendations match, the longest identifiers are shown first, up to three."
msgstr "Iyo Mwakirizi ya Syslog ari Igikoresho cya Cacti gifite uwagikoze umenyekana bivuye ku bisobanuro bya sisitemu ya SNMP cyangwa ku Nyandikorugero y'Igikoresho, kandi hakaba hari inama z'uwo wagikoze, hasuzumwa gusa inama z'uwo wagikoze n'izidafite uwagikoze. Bitabaye ibyo, abagikoze bose barasuzumwa, ariko ikirango kigizwe n'imibare gusa gihura gusa n'inama zidafite uwagikoze. Iyo inama nyinshi zihuye, ibirango birebire kurusha ibindi bigaragara mbere, kugeza kuri bitatu."

#: syslog_recommendations.php
msgid "Identifiers that contain other characters, such as the <code>#</code> slot placeholder or the <code>|</code> alternatives in some vendor documentation (for example <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), are kept and exported but can never match. Set <b>Can Match</b> to No to list them, and edit them into the exact code, for example <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."
msgstr "Ibiranga birimo izindi nyuguti cyangwa ibimenyetso, nk'umwanya wa <code>#</code> cyangwa amahitamo ya <code>|</code> mu nyandiko z'abakora ibikoresho bimwe na bimwe (urugero <code>%ASA|PIX-3-331001</code>), birabikwa kandi bikoherezwa hanze ariko ntibishobora na rimwe guhura. Shyira <b>Gishobora Guhura</b> kuri Oya kugira ngo ubitondeke, kandi ubihindure mu rukurikirane rwa nyarwo, urugero <code>%ASA-3-331001</code>."

